@startuml act_overall
!include _style.puml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam SwimlaneWidth same
|Project User|
start
:Sign in;
|Terra-Audit Server|
:Validate session, JWT and\ntoken version; derive org;
|Project User|
:Select project and field;
:Record evidence\n(seasons, observations, files);
|Terra-Audit Server|
if (Pathway?) then (cropland_alm)
  :Resolve practice, SOC,\nproduction, livestock\nand leakage evidence;
else (rice_awd)
  |Durable Worker|
  :signal_run job:\nSentinel-1 series +\nAWD threshold gate;
  |Terra-Audit Server|
endif
:Freeze snapshot and run\ndeterministic engine;
:Evaluate readiness\nand hard gates;
if (Hard gate blocked?) then (yes)
  |Project User|
  :Resolve blocking evidence;
  stop
else (no)
  |Terra-Audit Server|
  :Persist immutable version\n(draft / ready_for_review);
endif
if (ready_for_review?) then (yes)
  :Internal review of\nversion-pinned submission;
else (no)
  :Keep as draft and list\nremaining readiness items;
endif
|Project User|
:Export JSON / PDF;
stop
@enduml
